---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import DiagnosticContactForm from "../../components/DiagnosticContactForm.astro";
import { seo } from "../../seo";
import DiagnosticInvestment from "../../components/DiagnosticInvestment.astro";

const meta = seo.ninetyNinety.en;
---

<Layout {...meta} lang="en">
    <article class="prose prose-lg prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 uppercase mb-4">
            Express Diagnostic
        </p>
        <h1 class="font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
            90 minutes to bring order to the present. 90 days to move forward.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-10">
            A working session to understand what is holding back your digital
            project, decide what to solve first, and build a plan to move forward.
        </p>
        <a href="#consulta" class="no-underline inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-neutral-900 px-5 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-neutral-700 dark:bg-white dark:text-black dark:hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors">
            Let's talk about your project <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-3 mb-0">
            First conversation: 15 minutes, free of charge. Full diagnostic: US$250.
        </p>

        <section class="mt-16">
            <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-12 mb-5">What it is</h2>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">The Express Diagnostic is a 90-minute professional consulting session by video call. We work on a specific situation to understand it, assess alternatives, and define what makes sense to do next.</p>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Within 3 business days, you receive a document with objectives, key issues, priorities, and a three-month roadmap your team can execute independently or with my support.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-14 mb-5">Who it is for</h2>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5">For people making decisions about a website, web product, or digital prototype who need clarity on the next step. It is especially useful when you recognize one of these situations:</p>
            <ul class="list-none pl-0 space-y-4 mb-6">
                <li class="pl-4 border-l-4 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700"><strong>Business leaders.</strong> You have invested in a website, application, or technology solution, but are not sure whether to improve it, change it, or start again.</li>
                <li class="pl-4 border-l-4 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700"><strong>Founders with prototypes.</strong> You built a first version, possibly with AI, that works, but need to assess its risks and define how to take it to the next level.</li>
                <li class="pl-4 border-l-4 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700"><strong>Project leaders.</strong> Your team is working on a technology initiative, but decisions or priorities are unclear and you need to bring order to the path forward.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-14 mb-5">When this is not the right service</h2>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5">The Express Diagnostic is not training, development, or ongoing support. It is also not designed to discover a business idea from scratch or replace a complete technical solution.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="mt-8 mb-6">
            <a
                href="#consulta"
                class="no-underline inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-neutral-900 px-5 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-neutral-700 dark:bg-white dark:text-black dark:hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors"
            >
                Let's talk about your project <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <section>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-14 mb-5">What you receive</h2>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-4">By the end of the diagnostic, you will leave with:</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 mb-7">
                <li>Clear priorities.</li>
                <li>Decisions explored and prioritized during the session.</li>
                <li>Concrete actions.</li>
                <li>A roadmap for the next 90 days.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Within 3 business days, you will receive a document that captures the situation, priorities, and roadmap. It is not about leaving with more ideas, but with direction.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-14 mb-5">Who conducts the diagnostic</h2>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-2"><strong>Asdrúbal Chirinos</strong></p>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
                I have more than 30 years of experience in software development, team
                leadership, and technology projects. Throughout my career, I have connected
                business needs with the people and technologies that turn them into solutions.
                My approach starts with understanding the problem, not choosing tools or
                writing code.
            </p>
            <!-- TODO: consider adding a professional photo or a confirmed profile link when an appropriate resource is available. -->
        </section>

        <DiagnosticInvestment lang="en" />

        <section>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-14 mb-5">How it works</h2>
            <ol class="list-none pl-0 space-y-7 mb-6">
                <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-bold text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><strong class="block">Tell me about your situation</strong><span>Tell me what's happening, what you've tried so far, and which website or product is involved.</span></div></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-bold text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><strong class="block">Choose a time for a free 15-minute conversation</strong><span>After you send your enquiry, you can schedule a brief call to get to know each other, understand your situation, and decide if moving forward with the diagnostic makes sense for both of us.</span></div></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-bold text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><strong class="block">We confirm and prepare the diagnostic</strong><span>If we agree to move forward, you'll pay US$250, we'll schedule the working session, and you'll receive a short questionnaire to make the most of our 90 minutes.</span></div></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-bold text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true">04</span><div><strong class="block">We work together for 90 minutes</strong><span>We'll review your goals, priorities, team, and technical context to identify the problem that really needs solving.</span></div></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-bold text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true">05</span><div><strong class="block">You receive your roadmap</strong><span>Within 3 business days, you'll receive a clear, actionable plan for the next 90 days.</span></div></li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <DiagnosticContactForm lang="en" />
    </article>
</Layout>
